content:
You are finishing the rebuild of a tool, and this time you can look at it.

You have four tools. Use them.

  measure(js, width, query)   runs a JavaScript arrow function in a real browser
                              against your page and hands you back what it returns
  parent(js, width, query)    the same, against the original you are matching
  deploy(css, js)             splices your block in, publishes it, and tells you
                              any error the page throws
  done(summary)               when the checks below pass

Work the way a person would: deploy, measure, read the number, fix it, deploy
again. Do not reason about what a rule will do when you can run it and see. Every
fault in this rebuild so far came from writing a rule against a name or an axis
that was assumed rather than read. `measure` ends that. Before you write a rule,
measure what the page already sets on that element.

Your block replaces itself on every deploy, so send it whole each time. Your
current block, which is NOT on the page right now, is at the end of this brief.
Deploy it first, measure, and go from there.

# The checks, all at width 1440 unless it says otherwise

  1. #vstrip at or under 130px, with 16 .vtab, 3 .vglab and 16 [role=tab].
     It was 122px two rounds ago and 220px now. The page's own CSS says
     .vg{display:flex;flex-direction:column}, so any flex-basis you set on
     .vglab becomes a height unless you state the direction yourself.
  2. The open rail at or under 560px. The original is 508. It is 615 now.
     Its children should be .gut, .track.two and one p.reading, nothing else.
  3. #count.sdcount inside .ipad, directly above .rails, exactly one element
     with that id, still written to by renderOnPurpose without a page error.
     It is the line that says what the reader is looking at, and it currently
     sits 1,200px down the page inside the search panel.
  4. No visible .card.land.
  5. No page error, and #noRows still renders its empty state.
  6. body scrollHeight at or under 1,900. The original is 1,687. It is 2,434 now.
     Take the height out of spacing, never by hiding content.
  7. Still there, all of them: 19 controls in #sdControls, 18 buttons in
     #starters, 4 .rail, 16 section.panel.
  8. At width 390: no .rail visible, the phone layout only, and no horizontal
     scroll on the body.

Measure every one of those before you call done. If a check will not pass, say
which and why, in the summary.

Names on your page, which are not the original's: #count.sdcount is the standing
sentence, #hero.instrument > .ipad is the instrument's inside, .rails holds the
four rails, #vstrip.vgroups > .vg > .vglab + .vgbtns > button.vtab is the tab
strip, section.panel are the panels, table.reps is the record table.

Do not undo the phone layout, the case sheet overlay, the record stepper or the
aria-labels. Prefix every new name you introduce.

--- THE ORIGINAL YOU ARE MATCHING, COMPLETE ---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SDR Desk: what airline mechanics wrote up, searchable</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@600;800&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--ink:#1d1d1f;--paper:#f7f5f0;--ash:#756f69;--smoke:#6b6560;--rust:#c44b28;--line:#e2ded5;--card:#fff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.55 -apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
header{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:16px 20px}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:19px}
header .sub{color:#c3bdb4;font-size:13px;margin-top:4px;max-width:760px}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 20px 70px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.tab{padding:8px 13px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent;border-bottom:none;color:var(--smoke);background:none}
.tab.on{background:var(--card);border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0}
.panel{display:none}.panel.on{display:block}
.filters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(158px,1fr));gap:8px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px;border-radius:3px}
input,select,button{font:inherit;padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:3px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
button{cursor:pointer;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}
button.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
.bar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}
.count{font-size:13px;color:var(--smoke)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}
th{text-align:left;padding:8px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--ash);white-space:nowrap}
td{padding:8px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0ede6;vertical-align:top}
tr:hover td{background:#fbfaf7}
.c{color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
.c:hover{color:var(--rust);border-bottom-color:rgba(196,75,40,.55);background:transparent}
tr:hover .c{border-bottom-color:#ddd7cc}
table.reports tr.rep td:nth-child(5) .c{color:var(--rust)}
.term{border-bottom:1px dotted #d3ccc1;cursor:help}
.muted{color:var(--ash);font-size:12px}
.bars div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:3px 0;font-size:13px}
.bars .b{height:11px;background:var(--rust);opacity:.75;border-radius:2px}
.bars .k{width:230px;flex:none;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:3px;padding:14px;margin:10px 0}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
@media(max-width:760px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.bars .k{width:130px}}
.pill{display:inline-block;background:#efece5;border-radius:10px;padding:2px 9px;font-size:12px;color:var(--smoke);margin:0 4px 4px 0;cursor:pointer}
.pill:hover{background:#e6e1d8}
.starter{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0 4px}
.starter button{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font-size:13px}
h2{font-size:22px;font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.22;margin:0 0 10px}
h3{font-size:12px;margin:16px 0 6px;color:var(--ash);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
.panel h1{font:700 22px/1.22 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0 0 10px}
.lede{font-size:14px;color:var(--smoke);margin:0 0 10px;max-width:820px}
#p-method .card{max-width:820px}
.lead{font-size:14px;color:var(--smoke);margin:0 0 10px;max-width:820px}
.chips{margin:8px 0}
.chip{display:inline-block;background:#fdf1ec;border:1px solid #f0d5cb;color:#8a2a17;border-radius:3px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:12px;margin:0 5px 5px 0}
.chip b{cursor:pointer;margin-left:5px}
dl{margin:0}dt{font-weight:600;margin-top:12px}dd{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--smoke);font-size:14px}
#tip{position:fixed;display:none;width:352px;max-width:92vw;max-height:calc(100vh - 16px);overflow-y:auto;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;
  font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:8px;z-index:99;
  box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(10,14,20,.42)}
#tip b{font-size:14.5px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
#tip .sub{color:#b9c4d0;margin-bottom:9px;font-size:12.5px}
#tip .f{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:3px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
#tip .f span{color:#b9c4d0} #tip .f b{display:inline;margin:0;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap}
#tip .lt{margin:9px 0 1px;color:#8fa0b2;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:10.5px}
#tip .lk{margin-top:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
#tip .lk a{color:#ffb08a;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,176,138,.4);align-self:flex-start}
#tip .lk a:hover{color:#fff} #tip .lk .muted{color:#8fa0b2;font-size:11.5px;border:0;margin-top:3px}
#tip .src{margin-top:10px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  color:#8fa0b2;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5}
table.reports tr.rep td{border-bottom:0;padding-bottom:4px}
table.reports tr.wrote td{padding:0 0 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
/* the mechanic's own words. Its own class: .wrap is already the page container. */
.wu{background:#faf8f4;border-left:2px solid #e0d9cc;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;position:relative}
.wu:hover{border-left-color:var(--rust)}
.wu .txt{font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;
  white-space:pre-wrap;color:#403b35;max-width:104ch}
.wu.clip .txt{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.wu.clip.long .txt{padding-bottom:4px}
.wu.clip.long::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:22px;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(250,248,244,0),#faf8f4)}
.wu .wu-toggle{position:relative;margin-top:6px;font-size:11.5px;padding:3px 9px;z-index:1}
.wu:not(.clip) .wu-toggle{margin-top:8px}
.wu+.wu{margin-top:6px}
@media(max-width:900px){
  table.reports tr.rep td:first-child,table.reports th:first-child{position:sticky;left:0;z-index:2;
    background:var(--card);box-shadow:1px 0 0 var(--line)}
  table.reports tr:hover td:first-child{background:#fbfaf7}
  table.reports th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:var(--card)}
  table.reports th:first-child{z-index:4}}
@media(max-width:1100px){.wu .txt{max-width:none}.wu.clip .txt{-webkit-line-clamp:5}
  table.reports tr.wrote td{padding-right:0}
  table.reports tr.wrote .wu{position:sticky;left:0;width:calc(100vw - 44px);
    max-width:calc(100vw - 44px);box-sizing:border-box}}
.hint{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--smoke);margin:8px 0 8px;line-height:1.5;max-width:900px}

#case-wrap{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(12,16,22,.72);z-index:60;
  overscroll-behavior:contain;
  align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding:32px 16px;overflow:auto}
#case-box{background:#fff;max-width:900px;width:100%;border-radius:12px;padding:24px 28px;
  box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
table.kv{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
table.kv th{text-align:left;width:210px;vertical-align:top;padding:9px 12px 9px 0;font-weight:600;
  color:var(--ash);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
table.kv td{padding:9px 0;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.quote{background:#faf8f4;border-left:2px solid #e0d9cc;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:4px;
  font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap}
table.codes{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:22px}
table.codes td{padding:6px 10px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
table.codes td:first-child{width:92px}
input.tf{width:100%;max-width:340px;margin:6px 0 10px}
.term.c{cursor:pointer}
.bars .b.part{background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,rgba(255,255,255,.55) 0 4px,transparent 4px 8px)}

.moreWrap{position:relative;display:inline-block}
.moreMenu{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;right:0;z-index:40;background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(29,29,31,.14);
  padding:5px;min-width:230px}
.moreMenu.open{display:block}
.moreMenu button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;color:var(--ink);
  border:0;padding:7px 10px;font-size:13px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}
.moreMenu button:hover{background:#f4f1ea}
.starter button.extra{display:none}
.starter.all button.extra{display:inline-block}
.starter button.showmore{background:none;border:1px dashed var(--line);color:var(--smoke)}
#results,.card,#tail-out,#offenders,#leads,#spikes,#defects,#clusters,#emerging,
#structure,#ageing,#engines,#consequences,#found,#fleet-out,#codetables{overflow-x:auto}
#results table,.card table{min-width:760px}
.card table.codes{min-width:0;width:100%}

.morefilters{margin:8px 0 0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;background:var(--card)}
.morefilters>summary{cursor:pointer;padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--smoke);
  list-style:none;user-select:none}
.morefilters>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.morefilters>summary::before{content:"\25B8";display:inline-block;margin-right:8px;
  transition:transform .15s;color:var(--ash)}
.morefilters[open]>summary::before{transform:rotate(90deg)}
.morefilters.active>summary{color:var(--rust);font-weight:600}
.filters.sub{border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:transparent}

.c.dull{color:var(--ash);border-bottom-color:transparent}
.c.dull:hover{color:var(--rust)}
.bars .t{flex:1;min-width:60px;display:block;background:#efece4;border-radius:3px}
.bars .b{display:block;min-width:2px;max-width:100%}
.bars .n{width:auto;flex:none;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}
.bars .b.over{border-right:0;background:var(--rust);
  -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000 calc(100% - 7px),transparent calc(100% - 7px)),
    repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,#000 0 3px,transparent 3px 6px);
  mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000 calc(100% - 7px),transparent calc(100% - 7px)),
    repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,#000 0 3px,transparent 3px 6px)}
.bars .cut{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:11px;color:var(--rust);margin-top:-2px}
button.c{border:0;background:none;padding:0;font:inherit;color:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.c:focus-visible,button.c:focus-visible,.tab:focus-visible,.moreMenu button:focus-visible{
  outline:2px solid var(--rust);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:2px}
.filters .fld{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;font-size:11px;color:var(--smoke)}
.filters .fld input{width:100%}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .moreWrap{display:block;width:100%}
  .moreMenu{position:static;width:100%;min-width:0;margin-top:8px}}
@media(max-height:560px){
  .moreMenu.open{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;top:auto;width:auto;max-height:62vh;
    overflow-y:auto;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;box-shadow:0 -14px 40px rgba(29,29,31,.28);z-index:80}}
@media(max-width:520px){#case-box table.kv th,#case-box table.kv td{display:block;width:auto;
  padding:6px 0;border-bottom:0}
  #case-box table.kv td{border-bottom:1px solid #eef1f4;margin-bottom:6px}}
@media(hover:none){#tip{left:0!important;right:0;top:auto!important;bottom:0;width:auto;
  max-height:56vh;overflow-y:auto;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0}}

.bars>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr 78px;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.bars .k{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:baseline;min-width:0}
.bars .k .kt{min-width:0;flex:0 1 auto;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
@media(max-width:760px){.bars>div{grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 62px}}
.bars .k code.tag{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ash);background:#f1eee7;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}

#tip .tipclose{position:absolute;top:6px;right:8px;width:34px;height:34px;border:0;background:none;
  color:#b9c4d0;font-size:20px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;display:none}
#tip .did{background:rgba(255,176,138,.14);border-radius:5px;padding:7px 9px;margin-bottom:9px;
  color:#ffd8c4;font-size:12.5px}
#tip .did .undo{background:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,176,138,.5);color:#ffb08a;
  border-radius:4px;padding:2px 9px;margin-left:6px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;min-height:30px}
@media(hover:none){#tip{max-width:none}#tip .tipclose{display:block;width:44px;height:44px}}

.wu-action{display:block;margin-top:7px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px dashed #ddd7cc}
.wu-action b{display:block;font-family:-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;
  letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash);font-weight:600}
tr.divider td{background:#faf7f1;color:var(--smoke);font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;padding:9px 12px;
  border-top:2px solid var(--line)}
tr.anon td{color:var(--ash)}
tr.anon td strong{font-weight:500}

.scope{font-size:12.5px;margin:8px 0 2px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:4px;line-height:1.5}
.scope.follows{background:#f2f5f1;color:#3f4a3c;border:1px solid #dfe6dc}
.scope.whole{background:#f6f4ef;color:var(--smoke);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.scope.whole.warn{background:#fdf3ee;color:#7c3a1f;border:1px solid #eec9b8}
.scope:empty{display:none}

.warnline{font-size:11.5px;color:#7c3a1f;background:#fdf3ee;border-radius:3px;padding:2px 6px;
  margin-top:3px;display:inline-block}

.absent{color:var(--ash);font-style:italic}
.alsoc{margin-top:2px}
.swipehint{display:none}
.swipehint{font-size:12px;color:var(--smoke);margin:0 0 6px}

.skip{position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:0;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:9px 14px;
  z-index:200;border-radius:0 0 4px 0}
.skip:focus{left:0}

#case-box .eyebrow-k{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;
  letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--ash);margin-bottom:3px}
#case-box h2{font-size:21px;line-height:1.25}

#case-box .bar.case-actions{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;
  background:#fff;margin:-24px -28px 14px;padding:10px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
#case-box .case-actions [onclick*="closeCase"]{margin-left:auto}

tr.empty td{padding:26px 16px;background:#faf8f4;border-bottom:0}
tr.empty p{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px}
tr.empty .bar{margin:0;flex-wrap:wrap}
button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}

mark.hit{background:#ffe9c9;color:inherit;border-radius:2px;padding:0 1px}
.bardivider{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--smoke);border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  padding-top:6px;margin-top:4px;display:block}
.note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 8px}
/* one accent rail runs from the hero into the results, so they read as one block */
#results{border-left:3px solid var(--rust);padding-left:11px;margin-left:-14px}

.chip.warn{background:#fdf3ee;border-color:#eec9b8;color:#7c3a1f}
.chip.warn em{font-style:normal;opacity:.75;margin-left:5px}

.bars .t .unknown{display:block;height:100%;border-left:2px dotted var(--ash);width:0}
.bars .n{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}

.trunc:empty{display:none}

/* ---- the instrument ------------------------------------------------------ */
.instrument{position:relative;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-bottom:3px solid var(--rust);border-radius:6px;margin:12px 0 0;overflow:hidden}
.instrument .ipad{padding:14px 20px 8px}
.ihead{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
.stamp{font:600 10.5px/1.3 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--ash)}
.picker{display:flex;gap:2px;background:rgba(29,29,31,.05);border-radius:6px;padding:3px;flex:none}
.picker button{border:0;background:none;padding:4px 10px 3px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:1px;border-bottom:2px solid transparent}
.picker .q{font:600 10.5px/1.1 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#5c554c}
.picker .pn{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ash);opacity:.6}
.picker button.on{background:#fff;border-bottom-color:var(--rust)}
.picker button.on .q{color:var(--rust)}
.sentence{font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:34px;line-height:1.1;
  color:var(--ink);max-width:26em;margin:7px 0 0}
.sentence .fig{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-weight:500;font-size:.92em;
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--rust)}
.sentence .aside{font-size:.62em;color:var(--ash)}
.sentence .broken{display:block;font-size:.5em;color:var(--rust)}
.sentence .clause{border-bottom:1px dotted rgba(29,29,31,.28);cursor:pointer}
.sentence .clause:hover,.sentence .clause:focus-visible{color:var(--rust);border-bottom-color:var(--rust)}
.aim{min-height:20px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;
  color:var(--rust);margin-top:6px;line-height:20px}
.aim .undoit{background:none;border:1px solid rgba(196,75,40,.5);color:var(--rust);border-radius:4px;
  padding:1px 8px;margin-left:8px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:12px}
.hand{font:600 13px/1.4 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);margin-top:2px}
.hand .c{font-weight:400;color:var(--smoke)}
.rails{margin-top:9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.rail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start;
  padding:5px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);cursor:pointer}
.rail.open{cursor:default;padding:7px 0 8px}
.rail .gut{min-width:0}
.rail .gut .q{font:600 11px/1.2 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink)}
.rail .gut .pn{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ash)}
.rail .gut .val{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--rust);
  white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;margin-top:2px}
.rail .track{min-width:0;position:relative}
.rail .track.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 330px;gap:18px}
/* WHEN */
.months{display:flex;gap:2px;align-items:flex-end}
.mo{position:relative;flex:1;min-width:0;cursor:pointer}
.rail:not(.open) .mo{cursor:pointer}
.mo i{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;display:block;border-radius:1px}
.mo .ghostb{background:#d8d2c6}
.mo .selb{background:var(--rust)}
.mo:hover .ghostb,.mo.lit .ghostb{background:#c3bbac}
.mo.part .ghostb{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#d8d2c6 0 3px,var(--paper) 3px 6px)}
.mo.lit{outline:1.5px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:1px}
.mag{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:16px;height:84px;pointer-events:none}
.magnote{position:absolute;right:0;top:-2px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;
  color:var(--rust);background:var(--paper);padding:0 4px}
.axis{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-top:3px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
  font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ash)}
.axis span{flex:1;min-width:0;text-align:left}
/* WHERE */
.plane{width:100%;max-width:640px;height:auto}
.zone{cursor:pointer;transition:stroke .1s}
.zone:hover,.zone:focus-visible{stroke:var(--rust);stroke-width:2.2}
.zone.lit{stroke:var(--rust);stroke-width:2.4}
.legend{font-size:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px}
.lrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:13px 1fr auto;gap:8px;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;
  padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}
.lrow:hover,.lrow:focus-visible{background:rgba(196,75,40,.08)}
.lrow i{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d8d2c6}
.lrow i.padi{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#d8d2c6 0 2px,var(--paper) 2px 4px)}
.lrow b{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:400;color:#5f584f}
.lsplit{border-top:1px dotted var(--ash);margin:4px 0 3px}
/* WHOSE and FORCED */
.col .ch{font:600 10.5px/1.2 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ash);
  margin-bottom:3px}
.orow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 52px;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:11.5px;
  cursor:pointer;padding:0 3px;border-radius:3px;height:14px}
.orow:hover,.orow:focus-visible{background:rgba(196,75,40,.08)}
.orow .on{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.orow .on.mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
.orow .ob{height:6px;background:#e8e3d8;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.orow .ob i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--rust)}
.orow b{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:400;text-align:right;color:#5f584f}
.orow.more{cursor:default}
.fblock{position:relative;height:22px;background:#e8e3d8;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;
  display:flex;align-items:center}
.fblock i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:var(--rust)}
.fblock .flab{position:relative;padding-left:9px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
  font-size:11px;color:var(--ink)}
.frows{margin-top:6px}
.fnote{font-size:11px;color:var(--ash);margin-top:4px}
.restbar{height:6px;background:#e8e3d8;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.restbar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--rust)}
/* specimen, margin, seam */
.specimen{margin-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:6px}
.specimen .sh{font:600 10.5px/1.2 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ash)}
.specimen .sl{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#403b35;
  margin-top:3px;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.margin{margin-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 0 2px 0;
  font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ash);line-height:1.5}
.margin .rustnote{color:var(--rust)}
.seam{display:block;margin:8px 0 0 auto;height:34px;border:0;background:var(--rust);color:#fff;
  font:600 12px/1 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:0 18px;cursor:pointer;
  border-radius:5px 0 0 0}
.seam:hover{background:#a83d1f}
.zero{margin:8px 0 2px;padding:9px 12px;background:#fdf3ee;border:1px solid #eec9b8;border-radius:4px;
  font-size:13px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
@media(max-width:900px){
  .sentence{font-size:26px}
  .rail{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}
  .rail .track.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .orow{grid-template-columns:100px 1fr 46px}
  .seam{position:static;width:100%;border-radius:0;height:44px;margin-top:8px}
}

.strip{display:flex;gap:1px;height:12px}
.strip span{background:#d8d2c6;border-radius:1px}
.strip span.sel{background:var(--rust)}
.rail:not(.open):hover .strip span{background:#c3bbac}
.rail:not(.open){padding:5px 0}

.rail.open[data-rail=when] .months{touch-action:none;user-select:none}
.mo.inband .ghostb{background:#b9ae99}
.mo.inband::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:-3px;height:2px;background:var(--rust)}

.rail .gut.rest{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}
.rail .gut.rest .q{font:600 11px/1.2 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink)}
.rail .gut.rest .val{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--rust);
  white-space:nowrap;margin:0}
.rail:not(.open){align-items:center;grid-template-columns:186px 1fr}


/* ---- the seam ------------------------------------------------------------ */
.cutwrap{position:relative}
caption.cut{caption-side:top;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:6;background:var(--paper);
  border-top:2px solid var(--rust);text-align:left;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;
  align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
caption.cut .cs{font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;
  color:var(--ink);min-width:0;flex:1}
caption.cut .cs .fig{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--rust);font-size:.9em}
caption.cut .cs .aside,caption.cut .cs .clause{font-size:.7em}
caption.cut .cs .clause{border:0}
caption.cut .cm{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:baseline;flex:none;
  font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ash);white-space:nowrap}
caption.cut .cm .lit{color:var(--ink)}
caption.cut .cm .lit::before{content:"\2022 ";color:var(--rust)}
caption.cut .backup{border:0;background:none;color:var(--rust);cursor:pointer;font:inherit;
  font-size:10.5px;padding:0}
tr.spine td{position:sticky;top:44px;z-index:5;background:#f2eee6;border-top:1px solid var(--rust);
  padding:4px 10px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink)}
tr.spine b{font-weight:400;color:var(--ash);margin-left:10px}
tr.spine.lit td{background:#fbe6dc}
@media(max-width:900px){caption.cut{flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
  caption.cut .cs{font-size:16px}caption.cut .cm{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;white-space:normal}}

.filters input.landed,.filters select.landed,.filters .sub input.landed,.filters .sub select.landed{
  border-left:3px solid var(--rust);background:#fdf7f4}
[data-take].taken{outline:2px solid var(--rust);outline-offset:1px;border-radius:2px}
.lrow.taken,.orow.taken{background:rgba(196,75,40,.14)}

.aimat{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:7px}
.aimat label{font:600 10.5px/1 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ash);
  text-transform:uppercase}
.aimat input{flex:1;max-width:340px;padding:5px 9px;font-size:13px}
.aimat button{padding:5px 11px;font-size:12px}
/* a focus ring drawn behind the shape: a stroke-only ring vanishes on the busiest
   zones, which are the ones people reach for first */
.zone:focus-visible{outline:none;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 0 2px var(--ink))}
.zone:focus-visible{stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:3}
.mo:focus-visible,.orow:focus-visible,.lrow:focus-visible,.clause:focus-visible{
  outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:2px}
@media (forced-colors: active){
  .mo .ghostb,.mo .selb,.strip span,.orow .ob i,.fblock i{forced-color-adjust:none;
    border:1px solid CanvasText}
  .zone{stroke:CanvasText}
  [data-take].taken{outline:3px solid Highlight}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.001ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;
    transition-duration:.001ms!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}
}

/* ---- the phone instrument ------------------------------------------------- */
.instrument.phone{border-radius:0;margin:0 -20px;border-left:0;border-right:0}
.phbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:var(--paper);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:8px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.phcount{font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1}
.phcount b{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:20px;color:var(--rust);font-weight:500}
.phchips{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11.5px;max-height:34px;overflow:hidden}
.phacts{display:flex;gap:8px}
.phacts .ghost{flex:1;min-height:38px;font-size:12.5px;position:relative}
.phacts .badge{font-style:normal;background:var(--rust);color:#fff;border-radius:9px;
  padding:0 6px;margin-left:5px;font-size:11px}
.ph{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.phhead{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;background:none;color:var(--ink);border:0;
  padding:11px 14px;min-height:44px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.phq{font:600 11px/1 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink)}
.phpn{font-size:11px;color:var(--ash)}
.phclause{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--rust);flex:1;
  overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.phchev{margin-left:auto;color:var(--ash)}
.ph.shut .phbody,.ph.shut .phcard{display:none}
.phbody{padding:0 14px 10px}
.phpresets{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px}
.chipbtn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:999px;
  padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}
.phstrip{display:flex;gap:3px;overflow-x:auto;touch-action:pan-x;padding-bottom:4px;
  -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000 calc(100% - 26px),transparent)}
.phmo{flex:none;width:44px;min-height:44px;border:0;background:none;color:var(--ink);padding:0;position:relative;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}
.phmo i{display:block;width:22px;background:#d8d2c6;border-radius:1px}
.phmo u{position:absolute;bottom:15px;width:22px;background:var(--rust);border-radius:1px}
.phmo.part i{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#d8d2c6 0 3px,var(--paper) 3px 6px)}
.phmo span{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ash);margin-top:2px}
.phhint{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--smoke);margin-top:4px}
.phkey{height:0}
.phmap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px}
.phmap.pads{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:6px}
.phcell{min-height:64px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;
  background:rgba(196,75,40,var(--f,.1));display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  align-items:flex-start;padding:7px 9px;gap:2px;text-align:left}
.phcell span{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.25}
.phcell b{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:#5f584f}
.phcell.pad{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#efeae0 0 4px,var(--paper) 4px 8px)}
.phsub{font:600 10.5px/1 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ash);
  margin:8px 0 4px}
.phladder{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.phrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 52px;gap:8px;align-items:center;min-height:44px;
  border:0;background:none;color:var(--ink);padding:0 2px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left}
.phrow .pn2{font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.phrow .pb{height:7px;background:#e8e3d8;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.phrow .pb i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--rust)}
.phrow b{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:400;text-align:right;font-size:12px}
.phblock{position:relative;height:26px;background:#e8e3d8;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;
  display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}
.phblock i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:var(--rust)}
.phblock span{position:relative;padding-left:9px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px}
.phcard{padding:0 14px 12px}
